# WP Matrimony Pro — Project Progress & Setup Notes

## Project Overview

Custom WordPress Matrimony Plugin built for:

* Member registration
* Member profiles
* Search & filters
* Chat system
* Admin member management
* Editable user profiles
* Approval system

Plugin Folder:
`/wp-content/plugins/wp-matrimony-pro/`

---

# COMPLETED FEATURES

## 1. Home Page Search Redirect

Fixed homepage search form.

### Working Flow

Homepage search form now redirects to:

```php
http://localhost/lamp/members/
```

with query parameters:

```php
?gender=women&seeking=man&age_from=18&age_to=29
```

---

## 2. Members Page Filtering

Search filters now work correctly on members page.

File involved:

```php
includes/class-members.php
```

Filtering uses:

```php
$_GET['gender']
$_GET['seeking']
$_GET['age_from']
$_GET['age_to']
```

---

## 3. Default Profile Image

Added fallback image for users without profile photos.

Used in:

```php
wpm_get_profile_photo()
```

Fallback image path:

```php
assets/images/default-user.png
```

---

## 4. Admin Member Panel

Created custom admin page:

```php
Matrimony Users
```

Features:

* user list
* profile photo
* email
* gender
* status
* edit button

---

## 5. Admin Edit User Feature

Created dedicated edit page per user.

Features:

* edit gender
* edit phone
* edit age
* edit location
* approval status

---

## 6. Profile Page System

Profile URL format:

```php
/profile/username
```

File:

```php
templates/single-profile.php
```

Displays:

* cover image
* profile image
* about
* hobbies
* partner expectations
* gallery
* online status

---

## 7. Login Restriction on Profiles

Guest users see blurred content.

Login required for:

* full profile
* sending messages

---

## 8. Chat Popup System

Chat opens as popup now.

NO redirect to:

```php
/chat/?user=id
```

Instead opens modal/popup directly on profile page.

---

# IMPORTANT CHAT FILES

## JS File

```php
assets/js/chat.js
```

Important feature added:

```javascript
.wpm-start-chat
```

This opens popup chat from profile page.

---

## Chat Template

```php
templates/chat-box.php
```

Contains:

* sidebar
* conversations
* messages
* send form

---

## Important Fix

In:

```php
templates/single-profile.php
```

CHAT section was broken because of incorrect PHP condition closing.

Fixed section now works properly.

