# IMPORTANT NOTES

## Chat Popup Include

Always include:

```php
include WPM_PLUGIN_PATH . 'templates/chat-box.php';
```

before:

```php
get_footer();
```

---

## jQuery Required

Chat system depends on:

```javascript
jQuery
```

---

## Rewrite Rules

If profile pages break:

Go to:

```php
Settings > Permalinks
```

and click:

```php
Save Changes
```

